	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Ego, reverende pater, acta legatorum vestrorum legi et quidem percupide; <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>sed ut verum et ingenue fatear, intercessio legatorum nostrorum videtur <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>frigidissima.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Legatus noster, qui videri et haberi vult plane evangelicus <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>(cui tamen de hac legatorum intercessione nihil communicavi) affirmat <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>regem <persName>Gallum</persName> aliquam rationem tamen habuisse intercessionis legatorum <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>et minus quidem pollicitum esse propter proceres regni, plus tamen <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>praestare incipere eiusque rei argumentum affert, quod in <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> in pios <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>inquirere desitum sit quodque ex tanta captivorum turba praeter paucos <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>non sint concremati; sperat ergo indies et horas omnia meliora futura.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Quod utinam verum auguret!</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Narravit idem legatus et quidem <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>pro certo et comperto ducem <persName>Guisium</persName> expugnasse et vi cepisse <lb xml:id="p1z12"/><placeName ref="l2235">Caletum</placeName> oppidum munitissimum (Caleß) idque nuperrime.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="de">Er seitt, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>das sy im uff der post zuͦkommen; waar sy es, das der hertzog anfangs <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>großen schaden darvor erlitten habe, auch mitt schaden müssen abziechen.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Uß des herren red gespür ich wol, das die <placeName ref="l832">Französischen</placeName> sich des ports <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>vast fröuwend etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Haec nunc ad te, ne nihil literarum mitterem, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>qui vacuas potius quam nullas requiris literas.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Acta legatorum <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>per nobilem virum <persName ref="p8432">Fridericum a Salice</persName>, cuius adventus in expectatione est, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ad te proxime remittam.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Vale, pater reverende, et tuis omnibus <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>ex me salutem dicito.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l98">Curiae Rhetorum</placeName> 17. ianuarii anno 1558.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/><persName ref="p8009">Ioannes Fabricius</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>tui observantissimus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro eruditione et <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>pietate excellenti d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Bullingero</persName>, ecclesiae <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>antistiti fidelissimo, domino <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>et patrono suo plurimum <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>observando.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
